    <h2 class="text-center text-blue-900 font-bold text-xl mt-6 mb-4"><span style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold;">Объяснение Сердца</span></h2>
    <p><strong>1.</strong> <span style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: bold;">Намо Шри Самантабхадра</span><a href="#citation-1" id="ref-1" class="citation-mark"><sup>1</sup></a>!</p>
    <ul class="list-none mb-8 pl-2 space-y-1 ml-2">
